#. module: nme_base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_nme_base
msgid ""
"=========================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Base\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"Foundation of Nusantara Mini ERP, a small ERP for Indonesian distributors\n"
"built on Odoo 20 Community.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Master data shared by every module: products, hierarchical product\n"
"  categories, units of measure, taxes and payment terms.\n"
"* Customer and vendor flags and per-company payment terms on contacts. The\n"
"  NPWP (tax number) is Odoo's standard Tax ID field, validated by Odoo.\n"
"* Company settings: default sales/purchase tax and default payment terms.\n"
"* Abstract mixins reused by all business documents:\n"
"\n"
"  * ``nme.document.mixin``: sequence numbering, strict state machine\n"
"    (``_state_transitions`` + ``_set_state``), cancellation with a reason,\n"
"    chatter and protection against deleting confirmed documents.\n"
"  * ``nme.trade.document.mixin``: partner, payment terms and computed totals.\n"
"  * ``nme.trade.line.mixin``: product, quantity, price, discount, taxes and\n"
"    computed amounts.\n"
"\n"
"* A generic \"Cancel with reason\" wizard (``nme.document.cancel``).\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Go to *Nusantara ERP > Configuration > Settings* to choose the default taxes\n"
"and payment terms of the company. The module creates a \"VAT 11%\" sales tax\n"
"and purchase tax for the main company. Leave the tax fields of a product\n"
"empty for goods exempted from VAT.\n"
"\n"
"Security\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Every internal user can read master data.\n"
"* *Nusantara ERP / Master Data: Manager* creates and edits it.\n"
"* Products, taxes and payment terms are filtered by the user's allowed\n"
"  companies (shared records have no company).\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Author\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"License\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"
msgstr ""
"=========================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Dasar\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"Fondasi Nusantara Mini ERP, ERP kecil untuk distributor di Indonesia\n"
"yang dibangun di atas Odoo 20 Community.\n"
"\n"
"**Daftar isi**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Fitur\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Data master yang digunakan bersama oleh semua modul: produk, kategori\n"
"  produk bertingkat, satuan, pajak, dan termin pembayaran.\n"
"* Penanda pelanggan dan pemasok serta termin pembayaran per perusahaan pada\n"
"  kontak. NPWP (nomor pokok wajib pajak) menggunakan field Tax ID standar\n"
"  Odoo, yang divalidasi oleh Odoo.\n"
"* Pengaturan perusahaan: pajak penjualan/pembelian default dan termin\n"
"  pembayaran default.\n"
"* Mixin abstrak yang digunakan ulang oleh semua dokumen bisnis:\n"
"\n"
"  * ``nme.document.mixin``: penomoran urut, state machine yang ketat\n"
"    (``_state_transitions`` + ``_set_state``), pembatalan dengan alasan,\n"
"    chatter, dan perlindungan agar dokumen yang sudah dikonfirmasi tidak\n"
"    dapat dihapus.\n"
"  * ``nme.trade.document.mixin``: mitra, termin pembayaran, dan total\n"
"    yang dihitung otomatis.\n"
"  * ``nme.trade.line.mixin``: produk, kuantitas, harga, diskon, pajak, dan\n"
"    jumlah yang dihitung otomatis.\n"
"\n"
"* Wizard generik \"Batalkan dengan alasan\" (``nme.document.cancel``).\n"
"\n"
"Konfigurasi\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Buka *Nusantara ERP > Konfigurasi > Pengaturan* untuk memilih pajak dan\n"
"termin pembayaran default perusahaan. Modul ini membuat pajak penjualan dan\n"
"pajak pembelian \"PPN 11%\" untuk perusahaan utama. Kosongkan field pajak\n"
"pada produk untuk barang yang dibebaskan dari PPN.\n"
"\n"
"Keamanan\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Setiap pengguna internal dapat membaca data master.\n"
"* *Nusantara ERP / Data Master: Manajer* dapat membuat dan mengubahnya.\n"
"* Produk, pajak, dan termin pembayaran difilter berdasarkan perusahaan yang\n"
"  diizinkan untuk pengguna (data bersama tidak memiliki perusahaan).\n"
"\n"
"Kredit\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Penulis\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"Lisensi\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"

